{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical competitive shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the near future of 20XX, war has become a well oiled machine. Waifu operators hone their abilities on battlefields around the world, kawaii killers waging an infinity war without compassion or restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF strips multiplayer FPS gameplay down to its core: Pitched battles and frenetic combat on small maps specifically designed for mobility and verticality. The conflict evolves and escalates with every round. Over the course of a single match, a constant stream of new perks, abilities, and firepower can radically change your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune and theorycraft the perfect loadout with a deep equipment and perk customization. Every round presents fresh upgrade decisions that shape your path to victory. Select new perks each round to create your ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/f17a987bf8d40168c9e2c7b1071ad52f.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=355 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA net code with regional dedicated servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive live service bloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/bf0a3d32b7da2eb3904c960eb6bab261.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/b4a50ae46760a8e9e0599cbf18361e10.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your match earnings and fund your waifu mercenary company. Unlock &amp; recruit new operators to assist you in battle and build your Mother Base.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn base and company upgrades in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Mother Base to unlock new perks, weapons, and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with, or invade, other player\u2019s Mother Bases to achieve world domination.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2353050?t=1763926669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/334f0fb6b9626886d6bf65797e384bfd6b1f5872/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763926669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/f75a517be046d68d1f51ea601462c040d4d261ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763926669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/f75a517be046d68d1f51ea601462c040d4d261ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763926669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/29baa0e31f14afa46c351515a5377355.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF is an anime-style first-person tactical competitive shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/2ea7f98503ba9126f9b4418e38d39a1d.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the near future of 20XX, war has become a well oiled machine. Waifu operators hone their abilities on battlefields around the world, kawaii killers waging an infinity war without compassion or restraint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WTF strips multiplayer FPS gameplay down to its core: Pitched battles and frenetic combat on small maps specifically designed for mobility and verticality. The conflict evolves and escalates with every round. Over the course of a single match, a constant stream of new perks, abilities, and firepower can radically change your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.webm?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.mp4?t=1763926669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune and theorycraft the perfect loadout with a deep equipment and perk customization. Every round presents fresh upgrade decisions that shape your path to victory. Select new perks each round to create your ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/f17a987bf8d40168c9e2c7b1071ad52f.avif?t=1763926669\" width=800 height=355 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.poster.avif?t=1763926669\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314e